# Test: the send family offers its protocol, its form and every declared argument
# VALIDATES: AC-4 -- completion after `send` reaches the protocol, then the form,
#            then the arguments each handler reads, and the generated usage line
#            names the same arguments
# PREVENTS: a brand-new command path shipping with a tail the model does not
#           know exists, where completion offers nothing after the form word and
#           the usage line states a command that takes no arguments
#
# The three commands here are the ones
# plan/journal/command-takes-an-untyped-positional-value.md named on 2026-09-04:
# raw and update declared a selector and nothing else, and cache forward is the
# third member of the population the send spec moves.
#
# The usage lines are the MODEL's, rendered by command.Usage from the same
# ArgDefs the completer reads, so a leaf that stops being declared changes both
# halves of this file at once.
#
# `type` is offered beside its five values because the command runs without it,
# and a value a command runs without is reached through its own keyword
# (ai/rules/cli.md). A bare `open` is refused.

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=ze completion words run send
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=bgp

cmd=foreground:seq=2:exec=ze completion words run send bgp
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=raw

cmd=foreground:seq=3:exec=ze completion words run send bgp raw
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=selector
expect=stdout:contains=hex
expect=stdout:contains=b64
expect=stdout:contains=data
expect=stdout:contains=type
expect=stdout:contains=keepalive
expect=stdout:contains=route-refresh

cmd=foreground:seq=4:exec=ze send bgp raw help
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stderr:contains=ze send bgp <selector> raw <hex|b64> <data> [type <open|update|notification|keepalive|route-refresh>]

cmd=foreground:seq=5:exec=ze completion words run send bgp update
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=text
expect=stdout:contains=hex
expect=stdout:contains=b64
expect=stdout:contains=cursor

cmd=foreground:seq=6:exec=ze send bgp update help
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stderr:contains=ze send bgp <selector> update <text|hex|b64|cursor>

cmd=foreground:seq=7:exec=ze completion words run request cache forward
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=id
expect=stdout:contains=selector

cmd=foreground:seq=8:exec=ze request cache forward help
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stderr:contains=ze request cache forward <id> <selector>
